Yep!

44
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:16,079
Hello?

45
00:03:16,979 --> 00:03:18,719
Hey man, it's me, what do you do?

46
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:22,439
That's the worst impression of a guy I've ever heard, but nice try, Kate.

47
00:03:22,619 --> 00:03:26,119
Good job, look how smart you are, I should have known you'd guess.

48
00:03:27,379 --> 00:03:29,039
Right, well I'm glad you called.

49
00:03:29,479 --> 00:03:31,859
Maria just showed up here randomly and I don't know what to...

50
00:03:31,859 --> 00:03:34,639
I know, could you keep her for a couple days? I'd really appreciate it.

51
00:03:34,899 --> 00:03:37,399
What? I can bring her back if you want.

52
00:03:37,439 --> 00:03:38,219
Is she bothering you?

53
00:03:38,599 --> 00:03:39,499
Well, no, but...

54
00:03:39,499 --> 00:03:40,559
Uh, what?

55
00:03:40,619 --> 00:03:43,859
School's out for a few days, so I guess it's cool if she stays that long.

56
00:03:43,959 --> 00:03:45,979
You're the best, love you mean it!

57
00:03:46,259 --> 00:03:47,139
No problem.

58
00:03:48,719 --> 00:03:57,099
Oh, wow! I've never seen so much food in my life!

59
00:03:57,219 --> 00:03:58,519
It looks just like Christmas!

60
00:03:58,799 --> 00:04:00,159
Yeah? Well, not quite.

61
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:02,119
Is it someone's birthday? What's happening?

62
00:04:02,659 --> 00:04:04,539
God sure has some annoying minions.

63
00:04:04,959 --> 00:04:07,439
You're exactly what's wrong with the human race. Let's eat.

64
00:04:07,799 --> 00:04:09,839
Ah! What the heck is wrong with you?

65
00:04:09,919 --> 00:04:11,979
I don't remember seeing you pray for that!

66
00:04:11,979 --> 00:04:17,139
I belong to the night tribe. I do not know this god of whom you speak.

67
00:04:17,779 --> 00:04:22,539
Kobito, you don't have to give a sermon, but you can at least say thanks for the food.

68
00:04:23,359 --> 00:04:24,759
Thanks for the food, I guess.

69
00:04:25,019 --> 00:04:26,339
Nice. I'm proud of you.

70
00:04:26,339 --> 00:04:32,179
Hey! You can't just start without us!

71
