73
00:04:36,719 --> 00:04:38,479
Ah! Ah, sweet crap, baby!

74
00:04:39,259 --> 00:04:40,139
Ah!

75
00:04:43,259 --> 00:04:44,339
It's so yummy!

76
00:04:45,839 --> 00:04:48,639
Um, I don't remember you finishing your prayer, hypocrite.

77
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:52,399
God will understand that I'm saving this chicken from the mouth of an evil vampire.

78
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,839
Whatever, that's cheating!

79
00:04:54,119 --> 00:04:54,919
It's the truth!

80
00:04:55,039 --> 00:04:56,419
No, it's not! You made that up!

81
00:04:56,419 --> 00:04:58,839
Don't argue with food in your mouth, guys. You're gonna choke.

82
00:05:01,899 --> 00:05:02,719
Yeah, hello?

83
00:05:04,379 --> 00:05:07,519
Hey there, sexy. What color underwear are you wearing?

84
00:05:08,379 --> 00:05:09,779
What do you want now, Kate?

85
00:05:10,139 --> 00:05:11,499
Wow! You're good at this.

86
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:14,399
Anyway, no big deal. Just wanted to see if you're eating dinner.

87
00:05:14,579 --> 00:05:16,019
Yep, they're at the table right now.

88
00:05:16,219 --> 00:05:16,899
Okay, good.

89
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:20,939
Promise me you'll make sure Maria eats all her vegetables before dessert?

90
00:05:21,259 --> 00:05:21,659
Uh-huh.

91
00:05:22,399 --> 00:05:29,619
Great. Which one of you ate my dinner?

92
00:05:31,159 --> 00:05:31,719
She did!

93
00:05:36,099 --> 00:05:39,759
By the way, Maria, I'm really impressed that you actually found our house on your own.

94
00:05:39,879 --> 00:05:42,699
I never would have been able to find it. The hag dropped me off here.

95
00:05:42,979 --> 00:05:45,199
That's not exactly running away, then, is it?

96
00:05:48,079 --> 00:05:48,439
Hello?

97
00:05:49,059 --> 00:05:51,459
Hey, so how'd it go? Did Maria eat all her veggies?

98
00:05:51,459 --> 00:05:52,839
She ate a lot more than that.

99
00:05:52,959 --> 00:05:54,379
Good to know. Love you, mean it.

100
00:05:54,379 --> 00:05:54,419
Love you, mean it.

101
00:05:54,419 --> 00:05:54,639
Love you, mean it.

102
00:05:54,639 --> 00:05:54,739
Yeah.

103
