Big brother.

104
00:06:06,519 --> 00:06:09,919
Good, good, good news. I'll allow you to play a game with me.

105
00:06:09,919 --> 00:06:11,859
Ah! Ah, look at that!

106
00:06:11,859 --> 00:06:13,239
It's a porno game!

107
00:06:13,239 --> 00:06:13,279
It's a porno game!

108
00:06:13,279 --> 00:06:14,319
No, it is not!

109
00:06:14,499 --> 00:06:15,679
Yeah, I don't believe you.

110
00:06:16,019 --> 00:06:19,579
She's telling you the truth. It's a pretty normal game. Do you want to try it out?

111
00:06:19,579 --> 00:06:20,579
Oh, heck yeah!

112
00:06:20,579 --> 00:06:21,379
Ugh!

113
00:06:24,439 --> 00:06:26,599
