114
00:06:33,139 --> 00:06:34,099
K.O!

115
00:06:35,559 --> 00:06:36,339
Aww!

116
00:06:36,339 --> 00:06:38,839
You silly human.

117
00:06:38,839 --> 00:06:42,339
How foolish you were to think you could ever be a match for me.

118
00:06:42,339 --> 00:06:44,339
Not pulling any punches, are you?

119
00:06:44,339 --> 00:06:47,339
And now, Darkness Requiem!

120
00:06:47,339 --> 00:06:50,339
Come on! Please, you gotta wake up!

121
00:06:50,339 --> 00:06:53,339
K-O! You win!

122
00:06:53,339 --> 00:06:56,339
Coo-coo-coo. I win again. How predictable.

123
00:06:56,339 --> 00:07:00,339
