124
00:07:00,339 --> 00:07:02,339
Let's go, guys. Time for you both to take a bath.

125
00:07:02,339 --> 00:07:05,339
A bath? You mean all by myself at Big Brother's house?

126
00:07:05,339 --> 00:07:08,339
Yay! I'm going first! Hold those, please! Thank you!

127
00:07:08,339 --> 00:07:09,339
What the...

128
