Hey, the bathroom is over this way.

129
00:07:14,339 --> 00:07:16,339
Oh, whoops!

130
00:07:16,339 --> 00:07:19,339
Me and Big Brother take the same bath!

131
00:07:21,339 --> 00:07:23,339
Maria's taking a bath, Kate.

132
00:07:23,339 --> 00:07:26,339
Make sure she scrubs behind her ears. She always forgets.

133
00:07:26,339 --> 00:07:28,339
Are you actually that worried about her?

134
00:07:28,339 --> 00:07:30,339
No, I'm never worried about anything ever!

135
00:07:35,339 --> 00:07:41,339
Pretty. It looks just like fluffy white duty.

136
00:07:41,339 --> 00:07:44,339
Hey, Maria. I'm leaving some PJs by the door.

137
00:07:44,339 --> 00:07:47,339
They're cobatos, so they should fit. Don't stay in there too long.

138
00:07:47,339 --> 00:07:49,339
I made white duty!

139
00:07:50,339 --> 00:07:53,339
Ha! Watch this! Bam! Yeah!

140
00:07:53,339 --> 00:07:55,339
Uh, Big Brother?

141
00:07:55,339 --> 00:07:56,339
What's wrong, Maria?

142
00:07:56,339 --> 00:07:59,339
It doesn't fit. Do you have anything else I can wear?

143
00:07:59,339 --> 00:08:02,339
It's too tight, especially up here.

144
00:08:02,339 --> 00:08:04,339
I don't think I'll be able to sleep in it.

145
00:08:04,339 --> 00:08:07,339
Oh, okay. Sorry about that.

146
00:08:07,339 --> 00:08:10,339
But I guess that means you'll have to find somewhere else to go!

147
00:08:10,339 --> 00:08:13,339
Kobito, calm down. What's gotten into you?

148
00:08:13,339 --> 00:08:14,339
Sha-ding!

149
00:08:14,339 --> 00:08:15,339
Ah!

150
00:08:16,339 --> 00:08:18,339
It's Big Brother's T-shirt!

151
00:08:19,339 --> 00:08:21,339
Oh, my gosh! It's like we're connected!

152
00:08:25,339 --> 00:08:27,339
You are quite a foolish, godly minion.

153
00:08:27,339 --> 00:08:30,339
Once this battle is over, you will regret your mockery.

154
00:08:30,339 --> 00:08:32,339
Please, your threats don't scare me, you smelly vampire!

155
00:08:32,339 --> 00:08:33,339
Shut up!

156
00:08:33,339 --> 00:08:43,339
I wouldn't do that if I were you!

157
00:08:45,339 --> 00:08:47,339
K.O! You win!

158
00:08:48,339 --> 00:08:51,339
That will teach you not to question my powers.

159
00:08:56,339 --> 00:08:58,339
You're already exhausted?

160
00:08:58,339 --> 00:08:59,339
Not worth it.

161
00:09:03,339 --> 00:09:14,339
They say children grow best in their sleep.

162
00:09:16,339 --> 00:09:17,339
I'm going to sleep, too!

163
00:09:18,339 --> 00:09:20,339
What was that about?

164
00:09:25,339 --> 00:09:28,339
All right. Time for me to pass out, too.

165
00:09:29,339 --> 00:09:30,339
Oh, man.

166
00:09:33,339 --> 00:09:34,339
Is Maria in bed? It's late.

167
00:09:34,339 --> 00:09:35,339
She is.

168
00:09:36,339 --> 00:09:37,339
Oh, good.

169
00:09:37,339 --> 00:09:40,339
Hey, are you obsessed with your sister? Tell the truth.

170
00:09:40,339 --> 00:09:42,339
I am not obsessed with anyone! Screw you!

171
00:09:46,339 --> 00:09:47,339
What now?

172
00:09:47,339 --> 00:09:49,339
Yeah, I need to know if she brushed her teeth before...

173
00:09:52,339 --> 00:09:56,339
I will never sleep again as long as Maria's here. This has to end.

174
00:09:56,339 --> 00:10:00,339
Just hang in there. We're almost done, okay?

175
00:10:09,339 --> 00:10:10,339
Not so fast, kiddo!

176
00:10:11,339 --> 00:10:14,339
Apologize to Big Brother for all the trouble you caused him.

177
00:10:15,339 --> 00:10:16,339
Um, I'm very sorry for causing you trouble.

178
00:10:17,339 --> 00:10:18,339
She's not the one who should be apologizing.

179
00:10:19,339 --> 00:10:20,339
I owe you for this.

180
00:10:21,339 --> 00:10:22,339
No, Big. I'm glad I could help.

181
00:10:22,339 --> 00:10:24,339
So does that mean I can stay over again sometime?

182
00:10:25,339 --> 00:10:27,339
Of course. You're always welcome here.

183
00:10:28,339 --> 00:10:29,339
No, she's not! Don't ever come back!

184
00:10:29,339 --> 00:10:31,339
I didn't ask you, you disgusting vampire!

185
00:10:31,339 --> 00:10:33,339
I'll come back whenever I want! Big Brother said so!

186
00:10:36,339 --> 00:10:37,339
Bye-bye!

187
00:10:37,339 --> 00:10:42,339
Glad that's over. One more day and they would've killed each other.

188
00:10:43,339 --> 00:10:47,339
Coo-coo-coo. Only stupid little babies run away from home.

189
00:10:48,339 --> 00:10:50,339
Man, I guess that really got to her.

190
00:10:55,339 --> 00:10:56,339
Die, fiend!

191
00:10:56,339 --> 00:10:58,339
Hey, isn't it too early to be playing video games?

192
00:10:58,339 --> 00:11:03,339
I must build up my magic skills to prepare for the random invasions of God's foolish minions.

193
00:11:03,339 --> 00:11:07,339
Next time she's here, she will have no choice but to submit to my overwhelming powers.

194
00:11:08,339 --> 00:11:09,339
Coo-coo-coo.

195
00:11:10,339 --> 00:11:11,339
Next time she's here, huh?

196
00:11:24,339 --> 00:11:28,339
Seriously, school's only been out for three days and already there's nothing left for us to do.

197
00:11:28,339 --> 00:11:33,339
You make an interesting point. Do you have any idea what all the normal students are doing to kill time these days?

198
00:11:33,339 --> 00:11:34,339
And how would I know that?

199
00:11:34,339 --> 00:11:38,339
Rika has seen many manga where people are having hilarious parties together after finals.

200
00:11:38,339 --> 00:11:41,339
Rika thinks they were called Forget Your Cares parties.

201
00:11:41,339 --> 00:11:43,339
Oh yeah, I've heard of those.

202
00:11:43,339 --> 00:11:46,339
I see. Yeah, okay, maybe we should give that a try.

203
00:11:46,339 --> 00:11:48,339
What goes into planning something like that?

204
00:11:48,339 --> 00:11:52,339
I didn't go through the stress of studying for exams, so I don't have any cares to forget.

205
00:11:52,339 --> 00:11:54,339
Then I guess you're not participating with us?

206
00:11:54,339 --> 00:11:58,339
I'm so exhausted from thinking about worrying about finals.

207
00:11:59,339 --> 00:12:03,339
I understand. If you're that tired, maybe you need to go take a nap in the nurse's office.

208
00:12:03,339 --> 00:12:08,339
But what do you mean? Come to think of it, Rika didn't take the exams either, so she's not stressed.

209
00:12:08,339 --> 00:12:12,339
Um, teachers don't have to take the exams, but can I still come to the party?

210
00:12:12,339 --> 00:12:14,339
Of course, if that's what you want to do.

211
00:12:14,339 --> 00:12:16,339
Fine, I guess I'll go too.

212
00:12:16,339 --> 00:12:19,339
Sorry, can't. There's only room for about six people at these kind of parties.

213
00:12:19,339 --> 00:12:23,339
Shut up, you're just saying that to be mean. Why do you hate me?

214
00:12:23,339 --> 00:12:25,339
All right, does everyone have a drink ready?

215
00:12:25,339 --> 00:12:27,339
Rika does.

216
00:12:27,339 --> 00:12:29,339
Okay, then drink up.

217
00:12:29,339 --> 00:12:32,339
Wait, hold on a sec. Aren't you supposed to make a toast or something?

218
00:12:32,339 --> 00:12:37,339
Oh, okay. This is a toast to finals being over. So, cheers and stuff.

219
00:12:37,339 --> 00:12:39,339
Cheers and stuff!

220
00:12:39,339 --> 00:12:41,339
Cheers and stuff!

221
00:12:41,339 --> 00:12:43,339
Where are the snacks?

222
00:12:43,339 --> 00:12:44,339
You gonna be okay?

223
00:12:44,339 --> 00:12:48,339
I'm fine. This is embarrassing, but my body seems to have a bit of trouble with carbonated beverages.

224
00:12:48,339 --> 00:12:51,339
Then why the heck would you pour yourself one?

225
00:12:51,339 --> 00:12:54,339
I noticed it's what you're drinking, so I wanted to try it.

226
00:12:54,339 --> 00:12:58,339
If I want to be as wonderful a man as you, I can't let a little carbonation get in my way.

227
00:12:58,339 --> 00:12:59,339
Whoa!

228
00:12:59,339 --> 00:13:01,339
Whoa!

229
00:13:01,339 --> 00:13:04,339
Holy crap, are you sure you're good?

230
00:13:04,339 --> 00:13:10,339
I'm fine, thanks. Forgive me for being such a useless servant to you.

231
00:13:10,339 --> 00:13:16,339
Here, why don't I go ahead and drink the rest of this? Maybe grab some orange juice or milk instead.

232
00:13:16,339 --> 00:13:19,339
Um, hey, big brother?

233
00:13:19,339 --> 00:13:23,339
O-M-G! Interact Cat!

234
00:13:23,339 --> 00:13:26,339
When did you turn nine? Please.

235
00:13:35,339 --> 00:13:38,339
Hey, are you alright?

236
00:13:39,339 --> 00:13:42,339
Orange juice? So is carbonation still hard for you to handle?

237
00:13:42,339 --> 00:13:45,339
Huh? What are you talking about? Of course I can handle it!

238
00:13:45,339 --> 00:13:46,339
I just don't want to, okay?

239
00:13:46,339 --> 00:13:48,339
Still? Like, since when?

240
00:13:48,339 --> 00:13:50,339
Um, nothing. Don't worry about it.

241
00:13:50,339 --> 00:13:53,339
Crap, I forgot my past with Yozora is supposed to be a secret.

242
00:13:54,339 --> 00:13:56,339
Something funny's going on here.

243
00:13:57,339 --> 00:14:01,339
There. We already drank and ate snacks, so what's next on the agenda?

244
00:14:01,339 --> 00:14:02,339
Do you guys want to play a game?

245
00:14:02,339 --> 00:14:05,339
Party games are always fun. Rika thinks we should play the king game.

246
00:14:05,339 --> 00:14:08,339
I've never heard of that. How do you play that one?

247
00:14:08,339 --> 00:14:10,339
We all draw sticks to pick who's the king.

248
00:14:10,339 --> 00:14:13,339
If it ends up being you, then you get to make another player do anything you want.

249
00:14:13,339 --> 00:14:14,339
It's hilarious.

250
00:14:14,339 --> 00:14:15,339
Anything? Really?

251
00:14:15,339 --> 00:14:18,339
Like, if I wanted Yozora to lick the dirt off my feet, I could do that?

252
00:14:19,339 --> 00:14:21,339
Yeah, the king's orders are supposed to be absolute,

253
00:14:21,339 --> 00:14:23,339
